  "heading-notes": "Teske",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Jamirooje njiilaw",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Njiilaw ina waawi jogiide waɗe ngam ɓeydude laaɓugol. Waɗe kollirtee ko winndude innde waɗe e kiisol ceerndiraa e colon. Yeru, `list:Blocked` maa keer nuun karte gonɗe e doggol innde mum *Blocked*. So kiisol ngol jogii boowal walla alkule keeriɗe, ngol foti uddude e limle (yeru `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Waɗe goodɗe:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - karte e alluuje jaaɗɗe e *<title>* cuɓaaɗo",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - karte e doggi jaaɗɗi e *<title>* cuɓaaɗo",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - karte e laabi jaaɗɗi e *<title>* cuɓaaɗo",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - karte jogiiɗe yowre e *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - karte jogiiɗe maantorol jaaɗŋgal e *<color>* walla *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - raɓɓingol `__operator_label__:<color>` walla `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - karte ɗe *<username>* woni *tergal* walla *halfinaaɗo*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - raɓɓingol `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - karte ɗe *<username>* woni *tergal*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - karte ɗe *<username>* woni *halfinaaɗo*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - karte ɗe *<username>* woni cosɗo kartal",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - karte e alluwal halfinaangal fedde mawnde *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - karte e alluwal halfinaangal fedde *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - karte ɗe keerol mum woni haa balɗe *<n>* iwde e jooni. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ limtata karte fof yawtiiɗe ñalngu keerol mum.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - karte sosaaɗe balɗe *<n>* ɓennuɗe walla ko jaasi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - karte waylaaɗe balɗe *<n>* ɓennuɗe walla ko jaasi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - ɗo *<status>* woni gooto e ɗee:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - karte mooftaaɗe",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - karte mooftaaɗe e ɗe mooftaaka fof",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - karte jogiiɗe ñalngu timmoode",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - karte e alluuje peɛniɗe tan",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - karte e alluuje suturo tan",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - ɗo *<field>* woni gooto e `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` walla `__predicate_member__`. Waɗde `-` yeeso *<field>* yiylata alaa kiisol e gallal ngal (yeru `has:-due` yiylata karte ɗe ngalaa ñalngu keerol).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - ɗo *<sort-name>* woni gooto e `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` walla `__predicate_modified__`. Ngam deggondiral jippoowal, waɗ `-` yeeso innde deggondiral.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - ɗo *<n>* woni limoore timmunde ɓeyditte kolliroore limooje karte e kala hello.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Waɗe keewɗe mbaawi joopteede.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Waɗe nannduɗe njokketee e *OR*. Karte jaaɗɗe e sarɗol kala maa ngartine.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` maa wartin karte gonɗe e doggol kala innde mum *Blocked* walla *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Waɗe ceertuɗe njokketee e *AND*. Karte jaaɗɗe e waɗe ceertuɗe fof tan ngartintee. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` wartinata tan karte e doggol *Available* jogiiɗe maantorol *red*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Balɗe mbaawi joopteede hono limoore timmunde ɓeyditte walla ustite, walla huutoraade `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` walla `__predicate_year__` ngam sahaa gonɗo.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Njiilaw binndol reentataa darnde alkule.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "E goowangol, karte mooftaaɗe njiilataake.",
