  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Doggol __list__ hewtii keerol mum WIP. Artir kartal ngal e doggol goɗngol:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Doggol kala e ndee alluwal hewtii keerol mum WIP. Ɓeydu keerol, walla dirtin walla eggin kartal-ji e mooftirde, ngam artirde kartal ngal.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "Kartal-ji __count__ artiraaka: doggol-ji majji hewtii keerol WIP majji. Artir ɗi gooto gooto ngam suɓaade doggol goɗngol.",
